    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like a good conscience. it feels like i'm just a hollow person. i see people living their lives, being kind and actually doing things, and then i look at myself and realize i'm just a spectator. i'm just taking up space that someone better could be using. i don't think i belong here anymore.",
